TITLE Albite kinetics + fixed P gas H2S at 200C (H2S partial pressure 5 atm)
SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH 2 charge
    pe 4
    Fe(2) 4e-3
    Fe(3) 4e-3
    -water 1

GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 5
    H2S(g) 1

KINETICS 1
    Albite
        -m0 1
        -m  1
        -parms 1.0 10
        -steps 1000 in 100
        -tol 1e-12

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.csv
    -reset false
USER_PUNCH
    -head step time h2s_dissolved
10 PUNCH STEP_NO, TOTAL_TIME, TOT("S(-2)")
END
